    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.poster.avif?t=1754042988\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.webm?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.mp4?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A visual novel about a brother and sister who return to an island after losing their parents and confront a huge force that lurks in the sun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2+ hours of story<br></li><li>Full Japanese voice acting by seasoned professionals</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2>Seiran Island. Even here in paradise, there are those who work in the shadows to bring it down...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.poster.avif?t=1754042988\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.webm?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.mp4?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>United, these misfits stand side by side as the secret society NLNS.<br>As their founder and head honcho, I, Junnosuke Tachibana,<br>won\u2019t stop until we\u2019ve crushed this crazy law once and for all!<br><br>I\u2019ve even found a benefactor in this crusty old rich guy, name unknown...<br>He\u2019s hooked us up with a secret base and a buttload of cash already.<br>In return, he wants us to find someone and \u201cprotect her at all costs.\u201d<br>Apparently, she holds the key to our mission\u2019s success...?<br><br>In which case, there\u2019s only one thing to do: locate this mystery girl.<br>And all while keeping the SHO off our scent, too...<br><br>Make no mistake! I\u2019ll stop that law in its tracks, just wait and see!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/c6cad273e5bcfe9aa83c843f64ad274c.avif?t=1754042988\" /></span><br><strong>Nanase Katagiri (Voice: Hitomi Yanagi)</strong><br>The campus\u2019s resident baddie, rumored to be up to constant miscellaneous mischief by the student body at large.<br>The reality is that she\u2019s still very much a good girl at heart, but uses these rumors to her and Junnosuke\u2019s advantage to get out of unwanted sticky situations.<br><br><strong>Hinami Watarai (Voice: Shino Amekawa)</strong><br>Petite upperclassman who\u2019s actually in her third and final year. Despite appearances,<br>her short stature belies a big heart and a motherly knack for doting on others.<br><br><strong>Asane Tachibana (Voice: Soramame)</strong><br>Junnosuke\u2019s younger sister and most sympathetic supporter. Although somewhat of a recluse, she has a wild side to her, too.<br><br><strong>Junnosuke Tachibana</strong><br>The game\u2019s protagonist.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.poster.avif?t=1754042988\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.webm?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/0782b48417687246e43c95a23bf6f734.mp4?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A visual novel about a brother and sister who return to an island after losing their parents and confront a huge force that lurks in the sun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2+ hours of story<br></li><li>Full Japanese voice acting by seasoned professionals</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2>Seiran Island. Even here in paradise, there are those who work in the shadows to bring it down...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.poster.avif?t=1754042988\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.webm?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/180dfe0cb7919d1f40703742c126217c.mp4?t=1754042988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>United, these misfits stand side by side as the secret society NLNS.<br>As their founder and head honcho, I, Junnosuke Tachibana,<br>won\u2019t stop until we\u2019ve crushed this crazy law once and for all!<br><br>I\u2019ve even found a benefactor in this crusty old rich guy, name unknown...<br>He\u2019s hooked us up with a secret base and a buttload of cash already.<br>In return, he wants us to find someone and \u201cprotect her at all costs.\u201d<br>Apparently, she holds the key to our mission\u2019s success...?<br><br>In which case, there\u2019s only one thing to do: locate this mystery girl.<br>And all while keeping the SHO off our scent, too...<br><br>Make no mistake! I\u2019ll stop that law in its tracks, just wait and see!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399220/extras/c6cad273e5bcfe9aa83c843f64ad274c.avif?t=1754042988\" /></span><br><strong>Nanase Katagiri (Voice: Hitomi Yanagi)</strong><br>The campus\u2019s resident baddie, rumored to be up to constant miscellaneous mischief by the student body at large.<br>The reality is that she\u2019s still very much a good girl at heart, but uses these rumors to her and Junnosuke\u2019s advantage to get out of unwanted sticky situations.<br><br><strong>Hinami Watarai (Voice: Shino Amekawa)</strong><br>Petite upperclassman who\u2019s actually in her third and final year. Despite appearances,<br>her short stature belies a big heart and a motherly knack for doting on others.<br><br><strong>Asane Tachibana (Voice: Soramame)</strong><br>Junnosuke\u2019s younger sister and most sympathetic supporter. Although somewhat of a recluse, she has a wild side to her, too.<br><br><strong>Junnosuke Tachibana</strong><br>The game\u2019s protagonist.",
